.env
Data/raw/
# The actual raw dir on disk is capital-R "Data/Raw" (holds the ~126MB TIGER .shp and
# 80MB/50MB zips). The lowercase rule above only catches it on case-insensitive filesystems
# (macOS); this explicit variant keeps it ignored on case-sensitive ones (Linux/CI).
Data/Raw/
# Ignore processed data, EXCEPT the two small CSVs that make the committed
# regression (Code/analysis/joint_ols_spatial.py) reproducible by a cloner.
# Use Data/processed/* (not Data/processed/) so git still descends into the
# directory; a directory-form ignore would make the negations below ineffective,
# since git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded.
Data/processed/*
!Data/processed/blockgroup_access.csv
!Data/processed/blockgroup_g2sfca.csv
__pycache__/
.DS_Store

# Python virtual environment
.venv/

# Test / tooling caches
.pytest_cache/

.claude/

# Logs (keep the directory, ignore the log files)
logs/*.log

# graphify knowledge-graph output (generated, regenerable)
graphify-out/

# Rendered figures (regenerable from Code/figures/make_figures.py)
# Anchored to repo root so it does NOT match Code/figures/ on case-insensitive filesystems.
/Figures/*
!/Figures/*.png
!/Figures/README.md

# Stray Obsidian vault (not project content)
navster/
Paper_BACKUP_pre_airtight/

# Internal working files, not part of the published artifact
CLAUDE.md
references.txt
Docs/
logs/

# Built paper outputs — source lives in Paper/*.md + references.bib
ElecChargersPaper.pdf
ElecChargersPaperv2.pdf
